      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_07f8c4c886a780474b2dcd5e7bbb83161d63380448fa3a22cf52dab5ed0644b9",
        "slc_6b452ac7c99a3707d0e72acf75aed48ddd8d9e2f828bf907db5a8250672d50d9",
        "slc_935cc786b5712660f3d98bf8cddfc1c8ea17b8b3c0dc25efde9a5d22e8eefe73"
      ],
      "text": "Claudexor exposes a CLI, a loopback HTTP/SSE control API scoped to /v2 with POST /v2/handshake negotiation, MCP, ACP, and a macOS app as thin surfaces over the daemon."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_2fa9ca3b579f0d06808d44370250f41ebb4d5cf4da73009235b38eba9b13bcf6",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "87f08d28cf3366a27e099e05d489cf4631255c65",
          "git_sha": "ecb8ecdf1d005b7e98a0824826ff5b34af89b0b3",
          "line_end": 353,
          "line_start": 339,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "razzant/claudexor",
          "url": "https://github.com/razzant/claudexor/blob/87f08d28cf3366a27e099e05d489cf4631255c65/README.md#L339-L353"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_79fb93eeeef229e9b6e837ef3a0eca6955118deffff283f42cf16b3916f50be4"
      ],
      "text": "Canonical modes are ask (read-only, with --deep-scan multi-scout research), plan (with --council parallel multi-harness drafting merged into one plan), and agent (with --n best-of races, --attempts repair loops, --until-clean, and --delegate)."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_0810525c4f98fb835b0c70c6eb56e5b0738a42da9913e318c79bbca598ac2b77",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "87f08d28cf3366a27e099e05d489cf4631255c65",
          "git_sha": "ecb8ecdf1d005b7e98a0824826ff5b34af89b0b3",
          "line_end": 379,
          "line_start": 357,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "razzant/claudexor",
          "url": "https://github.com/razzant/claudexor/blob/87f08d28cf3366a27e099e05d489cf4631255c65/README.md#L357-L379"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_10acc7e1920384215422d497964100c9a10bd24c3074acc62361be0c3b1ad42e"
      ],
      "text": "The --delegate flag injects a scoped MCP belt exposing only ask/plan/run/best-of/status/result tools, with nesting depth 1, a default cap of 8 sub-runs per parent, and shared daemon-owned budget authority; only adapters declaring mcp_injection (claude, codex, cursor) can host it."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_85b684cefe7b1f6b226965d2a9dd5af31985b68cc7d2b0eb6aa4b2f500aa84e7",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "87f08d28cf3366a27e099e05d489cf4631255c65",
          "git_sha": "ecb8ecdf1d005b7e98a0824826ff5b34af89b0b3",
          "line_end": 439,
          "line_start": 427,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "razzant/claudexor",
          "url": "https://github.com/razzant/claudexor/blob/87f08d28cf3366a27e099e05d489cf4631255c65/README.md#L427-L439"
        },
        {
          "commit": "87f08d28cf3366a27e099e05d489cf4631255c65",
          "git_sha": "ecb8ecdf1d005b7e98a0824826ff5b34af89b0b3",
          "line_end": 425,
          "line_start": 412,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "razzant/claudexor",
          "url": "https://github.com/razzant/claudexor/blob/87f08d28cf3366a27e099e05d489cf4631255c65/README.md#L412-L425"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_03da5186cbb9fa92532f263453f469063cb5fe64210bbf9df1ac320cccce0e71",
        "slc_c81d64b0a0e1fc345fe51aa289614f64d43a9feec50af622153684fc44e58b7d"
      ],
      "text": "Read-only ask/plan turns resume the routed harness's native CLI session in a durable per-lane home; lane switches hydrate with a bounded continuation packet written to context/THREAD.md and disclosed via a typed session.continuity event."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
