          "git_sha": "ecb8ecdf1d005b7e98a0824826ff5b34af89b0b3",
          "line_end": 316,
          "line_start": 300,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "razzant/claudexor",
          "url": "https://github.com/razzant/claudexor/blob/87f08d28cf3366a27e099e05d489cf4631255c65/README.md#L300-L316"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2db2590c43bf118c5aba15c7f33453904da3035a1185977330302141eaf785d4",
        "slc_c011066b094d4be21d58b6a4b3b1cea32cabcce6cc140ca4dcc0de81157ce48d"
      ],
      "text": "Protected paths configured in .claudexor/config.yaml pause apply for a human decision; --allow-protected-path covers only engine-derived gate/test paths and cannot suppress project rules, and mutating turns on such projects are promoted one-way to an isolated worktree."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_c1ef2f2c1496e9431403bbc215544bd8b2183f9bfa98dde0acf90dce1378fb55",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "87f08d28cf3366a27e099e05d489cf4631255c65",
          "git_sha": "ecb8ecdf1d005b7e98a0824826ff5b34af89b0b3",
          "line_end": 102,
          "line_start": 90,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "razzant/claudexor",
          "url": "https://github.com/razzant/claudexor/blob/87f08d28cf3366a27e099e05d489cf4631255c65/README.md#L90-L102"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_8cb4dafe7b4221e0d8f03be391872587cfb3fc19682ed5805c4ff591d4fdf5ab"
      ],
      "text": "Prerequisites are Node.js >= 20.19, pnpm via corepack, Git for Git-backed worktrees, and at least one logged-in vendor CLI (codex, claude, cursor-agent, opencode, or agy) or a provider API key; the desktop app requires macOS while the CLI/daemon also run on Linux."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_82d8c8082968192cff8bc2d1973c3f0392484bf2d0594c05a0978fc069470640",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "87f08d28cf3366a27e099e05d489cf4631255c65",
          "git_sha": "ecb8ecdf1d005b7e98a0824826ff5b34af89b0b3",
          "line_end": 32,
          "line_start": 22,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "razzant/claudexor",
          "url": "https://github.com/razzant/claudexor/blob/87f08d28cf3366a27e099e05d489cf4631255c65/README.md#L22-L32"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_c25fba4dc9f676d9b6f58df6d771824e7693cf7394f5e317079eb081b8d668a6"
      ],
      "text": "The product is local-first: everything runs on the user's machine, files are the source of truth, and the README states there is no telemetry."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_d85b7930f41e70ca2aded742293af598331bce9a603873cfbcfca875f9e16088",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "87f08d28cf3366a27e099e05d489cf4631255c65",
          "git_sha": "ecb8ecdf1d005b7e98a0824826ff5b34af89b0b3",
          "line_end": 562,
          "line_start": 549,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "razzant/claudexor",
          "url": "https://github.com/razzant/claudexor/blob/87f08d28cf3366a27e099e05d489cf4631255c65/README.md#L549-L562"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_0a7b1a3353f98d375efe36b375617a7d4997d0e10fa1dfe905f0ef46a8b65bba"
      ],
      "text": "Cost accounting is typed: paid budgets are explicit via --max-usd with zero as a real cap, unknown cost is never reported as $0, and runs can end cost_unverifiable or budget_overshoot."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_e570d7b17b9d88894d3230dfc67c4d1fced1e9aded22b638681a1b3a508d9363",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "87f08d28cf3366a27e099e05d489cf4631255c65",
          "git_sha": "ecb8ecdf1d005b7e98a0824826ff5b34af89b0b3",
          "line_end": 807,
          "line_start": 798,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "razzant/claudexor",
          "url": "https://github.com/razzant/claudexor/blob/87f08d28cf3366a27e099e05d489cf4631255c65/README.md#L798-L807"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_6b452ac7c99a3707d0e72acf75aed48ddd8d9e2f828bf907db5a8250672d50d9"
      ],
      "text": "The monorepo splits packages/schema (contracts and generated JSON Schema), harness-* adapters, workspace (Git/directory envelopes), orchestrator (canonical mode pipelines), and review/arbitration/synthesis/budget packages."
    },
