        "slc_730185287ac32e38d8c2fba0a2ed3fcd77fb5670c93b397119474637ec390139"
      ],
      "text": "Repository development practice: contributors build with pnpm install --frozen-lockfile and pnpm build, then run typecheck, test, schema:gen with a generated-diff check, docs:check, and knip as gates."
    },
