  "summary": "Claudexor (v3.11.0) is a local-first control plane that orchestrates vendor coding-agent CLIs (Codex, Claude Code, Cursor, OpenCode, Antigravity) plus raw API adapters behind a daemon with a /v2 loopback control API, typed modes (ask/plan/agent), best-of races, review panels, credential profiles, and file-backed run artifacts. Evidence is README documentation only; development commands are correctly scoped to workflows. Evidence coverage: 91 of 133 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
